    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Floor Area Approx. 120 sq m / 1292 sq ft\n\nFlynn Estate Agents are delighted to present No. 4 Glenaulin Park to the open market. Ideally located just minutes from Chapelizod Village and within easy reach of Dublin City Centre, Glenaulin Park is a beautiful nature-filled cul-de-sac located just off the Lucan Road and only minutes from the vibrant Chapelizod Village and Phoenix Park.\n\nNumber 4 offers a unique opportunity to acquire a perfect family home, offering spacious accommodation, tranquil gardens and surroundings, along with your own private patio and secure access to the banks of the River Liffey.\nLocated in one of Chapelizod`s most sought-after addresses, this fabulous home is bound to attract significant attention.\n\nAccommodation on the ground floor consists of an inviting entrance hallway, lounge, dining room, family/TV room, and a kitchen/breakfast room with access to the living room. On the first floor, there are three spacious bedrooms with built-in wardrobes and beautiful river views.\n\nLocated within one of Chapelizod`s most sought-after enclaves, the location of this exceptional home is truly second to none, surrounded by a wealth of local amenities including schools, cafés, bars and shops. Phoenix Park is only a few minutes` walk from your doorstep, along with village staples such as Park Lane Deli, Baa Baa Café, Twirly Gate and The Villager pub.\nLiffey Valley Shopping Centre is only a few minutes away by car, and there are also several excellent secondary schools within easy reach, including The King`s Hospital, Castleknock College and Mount Sackville. The area offers direct access to the N4 and M50 national routes whilst also being approximately 5km from the city centre.\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Porch - 1.36m (4'6\") x 2.03m (6'8\")\n\nEntrance Hall - 4.27m (14'0\") x 2.11m (6'11\")\nCarpeted hallway with built in storage space under the stairs\n\nFamily Room - 3.56m (11'8\") x 3.82m (12'6\")\nCarpet flooring, marble surround electric fireplace, large recessed sliding doors with access to dining room\n\nDining Room - 4.24m (13'11\") x 3.83m (12'7\")\nCarpet flooring, gas fireplace, copper surround, stone hearth\n\nLounge - 4.45m (14'7\") x 2.75m (9'0\")\nCarpet flooring\n\nKitchen - 2.86m (9'5\") x 5.31m (17'5\")\nTiled flooring, fitted kitchen units, granite worktops, tiled backsplash, recessed lighting, built in storage press\n\nUtility - 3.15m (10'4\") x 2.21m (7'3\")\nTiled flooring, access to garden\n\nGuest WC - 1.59m (5'3\") x 0.89m (2'11\")\nTiled flooring, partially tiled walls, WC\n\nLanding - 2.48m (8'2\") x 1.09m (3'7\")\nCarpet flooring\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.09m (13'5\") x 3.49m (11'5\")\nCarpet flooring, fitted wardrobes, fitted dressing table, recessed lighting\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.47m (11'5\") x 3.72m (12'2\")\nCarpet flooring, fitted wardrobes, built in dressing table\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.74m (9'0\") x 2.48m (8'2\")\nCarpet flooring, fitted wall shelf, large window allowing natural light\n\nMain Bathroom - 2.46m (8'1\") x 2.38m (7'10\")\nTiled flooring and walls, walk in shower with glass enclosure, WC, WHB, heated towel rail, recessed lighting\n\n"
      },
